@startuml AGV_State_Machine

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> PATH_PLANNING : requestStart()
PATH_PLANNING --> MOVING : path computed

MOVING --> OBSTACLE_DETECTED : distance <= 15cm
MOVING --> DOCKED : reached target position

OBSTACLE_DETECTED --> REROUTING : assessment complete (0.3s)

REROUTING --> MOVING : maneuver complete

IDLE --> ERROR : fault detected
PATH_PLANNING --> ERROR : fault detected
MOVING --> ERROR : fault detected
OBSTACLE_DETECTED --> ERROR : fault detected
REROUTING --> ERROR : fault detected

DOCKED --> [*]
ERROR --> [*]

note right of REROUTING
  Backs up (0.8s), then
  turns to bypass obstacle
  (1.2s), then resumes
end note

note right of ERROR
  Reachable from any state.
  Requires supervisor
  reset/acknowledge to exit
  (not yet implemented).
end note

@enduml